message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "biowarden"
version: 0.0.1
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/BrianP2002/biowarden"
url: "https://github.com/BrianP2002/biowarden"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ha"
    given-names: "Lin"
abstract: >-
  Catch silent errors in bioinformatics tool calls before they run, and measure how often LLM agents
  make them. The project has a checking layer of 108 rules that blocks such a call and prints a
  fix, and a benchmark of 105 clean/faulted task families that was used in two studies with written
  plans (the second frozen by a SHA-256 manifest before its runs; no external registry).
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - LLM agents
  - silent errors
  - tool calls
  - benchmark
  - rule engine
  - Model Context Protocol
